{
  "266.csv::168": {
    "id": "266.csv::168",
    "source_text": "ああこの感じ――侵食魔と同じ",
    "translated_text": "Ah, this feeling... &#x27;tis the same as the Corruption Demon.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:15:52.123624",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:15:52.124861",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 168,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::169": {
    "id": "266.csv::169",
    "source_text": "くう――意外と強い！",
    "translated_text": "Kgh—&#x27;tis stronger than expected!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:16:10.758928",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:16:10.763320",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 169,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::170": {
    "id": "266.csv::170",
    "source_text": "レオが亡くなったと聞きました\nその顔を見ると――ああ、本当なんですね",
    "translated_text": "I heard Leo had passed. Seeing your face — ah, &#x27;tis true.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:16:53.341568",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:16:53.344132",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 170,
    "speaker": "Pamela",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::171": {
    "id": "266.csv::171",
    "source_text": "レオの、言葉に憂いがなく――\n澄んだ目で遠くを見ていたあの姿――",
    "translated_text": "Leo&#x27;s words bore no sorrow—\nThat figure, gazing into the distance with clear eyes—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:17:06.800778",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:17:06.803788",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 171,
    "speaker": "Loeg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::172": {
    "id": "266.csv::172",
    "source_text": "最期の瞬間まで覚者らしくあろうという\n覚悟の賜物だったのかもしれないね",
    "translated_text": "Mayhap &#x27;twas the fruit of their resolve to remain an Arisen until the very end.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:17:56.325573",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:17:56.328858",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 172,
    "speaker": "Loeg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::81": {
    "id": "266.csv::81",
    "source_text": "レオはまだ戻らないようだが――\n先に敵の素性を話しておこう",
    "translated_text": "Leo has yet to return, it seems—allow me to tell you the foe&#x27;s nature first.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:22:11.980476",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:22:11.984153",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 81,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::82": {
    "id": "266.csv::82",
    "source_text": "また、灰色のうろこが増えています\n誰も気にしていないように見えますが――",
    "translated_text": "The gray scales increase once more.\nNone seem to heed them, yet—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:22:37.393293",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:22:37.397827",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 82,
    "speaker": "Mysial",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::83": {
    "id": "266.csv::83",
    "source_text": "――へぇ、女性を探しに、わざわざ来たの\n情熱的なことね",
    "translated_text": "...My my, you came all this way to seek a woman. How ardent of you.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:24.920006",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:24.922999",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 83,
    "speaker": "Nadia",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::84": {
    "id": "266.csv::84",
    "source_text": "わたしは大丈夫だから――",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;m fine—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:43.139036",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:43.142283",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 84,
    "speaker": "Iris",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::85": {
    "id": "266.csv::85",
    "source_text": "機嫌――いや、気分はどんな様子だった？\n表情や言動から何か――",
    "translated_text": "Mood... no, what was their condition?\nAnything from their expression or behavior—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:55.772722",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:23:55.776440",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 85,
    "speaker": "Leo",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::86": {
    "id": "266.csv::86",
    "source_text": "いや――\nたった今、元気だと聞いたばかりだったな",
    "translated_text": "Nay — I was just told they are well.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:24:37.428596",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T21:24:37.433437",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 86,
    "speaker": "Leo",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::178": {
    "id": "266.csv::178",
    "source_text": "エリオットの負傷で、ああ、これでもう\nわしらだけで戦うしかないと覚悟したが――",
    "translated_text": "Elliot&#x27;s wound, ah, I&#x27;d resolved we&#x27;d have to fight alone now—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:09.218529",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:09.222223",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 178,
    "speaker": "Meirova",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::179": {
    "id": "266.csv::179",
    "source_text": "神にも等しい竜の眼でひと睨み",
    "translated_text": "With a dragon&#x27;s gaze equal to the gods, I cast a single glare upon thee.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:41.428463",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:41.431964",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\266.csv",
    "row_index": 179,
    "speaker": "The Evil Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "266.csv::180": {
    "id": "266.csv::180",
    "source_text": "キャキャキャ――他には何もいらん",
    "translated_text": "Ahahaha... Naught else do I require.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:54.302623",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T00:01:54.305933",
